---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Rental Billing | Hutzell Aviation" description="Hutzell Aviation renter billing, prepaid block-hour balances, and post-flight reconciliation.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="checkout-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow light"><span></span> RENTER BILLING</p><h1>Flight balances now live in your renter account.</h1><p>Prepaid 15-, 25-, and 50-hour packages are tracked against actual finalized aircraft time. If a flight exceeds your eligible prepaid balance, the remainder appears as a pay-as-you-go charge.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section checkout-section"><div class="container"><div class="checkout-form-card payment-roadmap"><Icon name="dollar" size={34}/><h2>Billing ledger active. Online card checkout comes next.</h2><p>Tyler can record prepaid block purchases and received payments in the admin dashboard. Renters can see current block hours, expiration dates, payment status, and flight reconciliation from their account. A direct online card processor is intentionally not enabled until a merchant/payment provider is connected.</p><div class="account-actions"><a class="button" href={`${base}account/`}>Open Renter Account</a><a class="button button-outline" href={`${base}pricing/`}>View Rental Rates</a></div></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
